LocateU is an APP that keeps you in touch with your family and friends at all times. Find a friend through mobile phone number, and after obtaining his/her consent, and you can view his/her real-time location information so as to protect the safety of you and your family, even if they are thousands of miles away.
LocateU is the bond between family members:
No matter where you are, you can get real-time location information of your family;
You can know where your family has been by viewing their tracking history;
In case of danger, you can ask your family for help with just one click to protect the safety of family members; 
Track mobile phone after it is stolen or lost
Share your location with family members;
Even when you're busy, it is easy to get in touch with your family; 
In need of help, your family can get the message at the first time; 
Optional permission request:
Location services, to inform your family of your current location;
Contacts, to find other users to add as friends;
Storage, to store your tracking history;
Note: Location information can only be shared with friends after they agree. We are very concerned about the privacy of you and your family; therefore, please share location information with people you trust.
In addition, LocateU collects location information only for real-time location sharing between friends and for emergency help, while the app is in use or after it is closed.
For our privacy policy and terms of use, please click:
https://api.locate-u.com/html/privacy.html
https://api.locate-u.com/html/service.html
You can also go to the APP customer service page for feedback and suggestions.

EasyWay mobile – current public transport routes in your mobile

Service is provided in:
 - Bulgaria (Sofia, Burgas, Pleven, Plovdiv, Varna);
 - Croatia (Zagreb);
 - Kazakhstan (Astana, Almaty);
 - Moldova (Chisinau, Tiraspol, Bender, Balti);
 - Russia (51 major city);
 - Serbia (Belgrade);
 - Ukraine (56 major cities);
 - Belorussia (Minsk);
 - Uzbekistan (Tashkent).

Realtime data is provided in the selected cities, partial coverage may apply:
 - Russia (Omsk, Samara, St.Petersburg, Krasnoyarsk, Perm, Novosibirsk, Kazan);
 - Ukraine (Kyiv, Kharkiv, Dnipro, Lviv, Mariupol, Kherson, Mykolaiv, Kryvyi Rih, Zhytomyr, Kropyvnytskyi, Sumy, Poltava, Oleksandria, Druzhkivka, Drohobych, Truskavets);
 - Moldova (Chisinau)
 - Bulgaria (Varna)

Features:
 - Offline-mode;
 - Optimal A to B route search;
 - Full list of current public transport routes, display-on-the-map possibility in the provided cities
 - Route scheme, schedule or interval, service time and travel cost;
 - GPS tracking of your movement;
 - Public Transport GPS-data for selected cities;
 - Real-time Stop schedule and Route direction;
 - Bookmarks, Cities and Routes Cache for traffic optimization;
 - Information on wheelchair accessible transport;
 - Multi-language interface.

Speedometer lets you determine the exact speed of all types of transport. The app shows the current, average and maximum speed, and tracks the distance traveled. For usability purposes, the app features a projection display mode and displays your current location on the map.

Both miles per hour (mph) and kilometers per hour (km/h) are supported as speed measurement units.

The app uses your phone’s GPS to accurately determine your speed. Therefore, access to your location is required for proper operation.

Key features:
• Determine the current, average and maximum speed in imperial/metric measurement units;
• Measure the distance traveled;
• Track location on a map;
• Calculate the acceleration time;
• Windscreen projection display mode;
• Speed limit control mode. Visual and sound effects will warn you if the established speed limit is exceeded;
• Simple user interface.

You can purchase an auto-renewable subscription to get full access. Your subscription will be charged to your iTunes account at confirmation of purchase. The subscription automatically renews for the same price and the duration period depends on the selected plan (weekly, monthly, yearly) unless canceled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. You can turn off the auto-renewal feature at any time by changing your account settings. 

